  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "stack-2021-12-01",
  "description": "\n\n\n    ReasonStack-Prime\n    A highly normalized, streaming-optimized Stack Exchange corpus engineered for LLM reasoning and instruction tuning.\n    \n        CC BY-SA 4.0\n        ~1M Rows\n        176 Parquet Shards\n        21 SE Sites\n    \n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t1. Executive Summary\n\t\n\nReasonStack-Prime is a large-scale, meticulously curated text dataset derived from the official Archive.org Stack Exchange data dump (Version 2021-12-07). Unlike raw XML dumps or poorly cleaned JSON exports, this dataset\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/AdhyanshVerma/stack-2021-12-01.",
  "alternateName": [
    "AdhyanshVerma/stack-2021-12-01",
    "ReasonStack-Prime"
  ],
